# --- Native app (Tauri shell) - everything lives under native/ ---
# Only the generated/heavy parts are ignored; native/package.json + the src-tauri
# source ARE tracked (they sit under native/, so the root-anchored Cloudflare build
# never sees a package.json and can't be nudged into `npm install` on push).
native/node_modules/
# Assembled frontend bundle + cached CDN WASM downloads (rebuilt by build-dist.mjs).
native/dist/
native/.native-cache/
# Rust build artifacts + generated mobile scaffolds (also in native/src-tauri/.gitignore).
native/src-tauri/target/
native/src-tauri/gen/
